<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 5-yr govt. bond yield rises to 15.98 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 5-yr govt. bond yield rises to 15.98 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's five-year government bonds was set by auction at 15.98 percent, up from 15.85 percent at an auction on March 27, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>BONDS OF THE 2001/C SERIES</p>
<p>    Date of issue		 3 February 1997</p>
<p>    Date of maturity	   12 December 2001</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     4,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     14,080 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  15.98 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		   98.72 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: The bond bears a fixed interest rate of 15.00 percent, payable semi- anually starting from June 12, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
